    <!-- Task 3: Add a paragraph about your text editor -->
    <p>I am using Notepad++ as my text editor to complete this assignment.</p>

    <!-- Task 4: Add a paragraph that summarizes Chapter 1 -->
    <p>
        Chapter 1 provides an overview of webpage design and all of the design elements that must be taken into consideration 
        when creating a webpage. Before you begin coding a website, you must first create a wireframe and site map. 
        Next, you need to consider several design elements, such as graphics, navigation, and color. 
        Finally, you must also plan for accessibility.
    </p>

    <!-- Task 5: Add another paragraph about what you learned -->
    <p>
        After reading Chapter 1, I now understand how to download and use a text editor to create an HTML page. 
        I know which HTML elements are required to create a basic HTML webpage.
    </p>

    <!-- Task 6: Insert a horizontal rule -->
